  "body": "This beach is a rare treasure - tucked away at the end of a cul de sac, sheltered, peaceful, and bathed in all day sun. A private pedestrian gate leads from your garden directly to the sand, plus a large sliding gate opens to the beachfront reserve, perfect for sailing families and water sport lovers wanting effortless launching for small boats and water toys. Safe swimming and a generous park create a relaxed, family friendly atmosphere, all moments from excellent schools and vibrant local cafés. \r\n\r\n The architecturally designed home opens to uninterrupted sea and island views that feel almost cinematic. Every room is drawn to the ocean, with beautiful heart timber flooring adding warmth and character to the contemporary design. The master suite and guest room enjoys private deck access, while generous family bedrooms provide ample space for everyone. Dual offices, and a self-contained lower level offer superb flexibility for modern living. Sunlight pours through the home and garden where everyday life feels like time spent on a relaxed family holiday.\r\n\r\n Outdoor living is exceptional, with multiple spaces to enjoy the sea air. The palisade and seawall frontage provide both peace of mind and a beautiful, practical connection to the beach. For more intimate entertaining, the sheltered rear courtyard offers a spa pool and outdoor kitchen – an all-weather retreat that opens directly from the main lounge. The oversized garage includes increased height to accommodate a Sea Legs - a great bonus for boating families.\r\n\r\n A rare blend of architecture, absolute beachfront position, and effortless coastal lifestyle. A waterfront opportunity that is truly irreplaceable.",
